1	//! The diff view: a file's uncommitted changes, the file as of the last
2	//! commit against the file on disk, in an inset panel. It lays them out side by side or unified, switchable and
3	//! remembered; marks changed lines with a tint, a +/− marker, and both line
4	//! numbers, and the words that changed within a line with a stronger tint;
5	//! collapses unchanged lines far from any change into a row that expands them;
6	//! and steps from change to change with F7 and Shift+F7. It follows the file as
7	//! it changes on disk.
8	
